no GPUs: GPU -1 ()
MD code: GPU 2 (assigned by the MD code)
MD code, not available: GPU 1 (the GPU the MD code is using; the GPU 5 assigned by the MD code is not among the 4 available)
MD code, not available, no caller: GPU 3 (the default; the GPU 5 assigned by the MD code is not among the 4 available)
caller: GPU 1 (the GPU the MD code is using)
caller, not available: GPU 2 (chosen in the environment)
environment: GPU 2 (chosen in the environment)
default: GPU 0 (the default)
default, one GPU: GPU 0 (the default)
default, wrong runtime device: GPU 0 (the default)
rank, launcher before SLURM: GPU 1 (process 5 of the node, from OMPI_COMM_WORLD_LOCAL_RANK, with 4 GPUs)
rank, one GPU: GPU 0 (the default)
rank, MD code first: GPU 3 (assigned by the MD code)
rank, caller first: GPU 2 (the GPU the MD code is using)
rank, environment first: GPU 3 (chosen in the environment)
rank, SLURM: GPU 1 (process 3 of the node, from SLURM_LOCALID, with 2 GPUs)
rank, not a number: GPU 1 (the default)
rank, negative: GPU 1 (the default)
caller CUDA device: -1
